@startuml
title 整體架構：模組化單體 + Kafka 內部解耦

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

' ===== 第 0 層：外部來源 =====
actor "行銷人員" as MK
[電商主站] as STORE

' ===== 單一部署單元（campaign 在上、reach 在下，垂直堆疊）=====
package "campaign-reach-system（單一部署）" as APP {

  package "campaign 模組" as P_CAMPAIGN #E8F0FE {
    [Campaign API] as API
    [Campaign Consumer] as CC
    [Scheduler] as SCH
    [Evaluators\n(Promotion / ReachTrigger)] as EVAL
  }

  package "shared kernel" as P_SHARED #FFF4E5 {
    [Event Schema] as EVT
    [Config] as CFG
    note as N_SHARED #FFFFFF
      **用意：只放跨模組穩定契約**
      event schema、common exception、基礎 config。
      禁止放入 campaign/reach 的
      entity / repository / service，
      以免退化成耦合中心、破壞模組邊界。
    end note
  }

  package "reach 模組" as P_REACH #E6F4EA {
    [Orchestrator] as ORC
    [AudienceResolver] as AR
    [Dispatcher] as DSP
    [EmailAdapter] as EA
    note as N_REACH #FFFFFF
      **用意：發給誰、怎麼發、如何追蹤**
      受眾解析、任務展開、發送/重試/DLQ 全在此。
    end note
  }
}

' ===== 基礎設施（部署單元正下方）=====
package "基礎設施" as INFRA #F3F3F3 {
  queue "Kafka:\ndomain.events" as DE
  queue "Kafka:\nreach.requested" as RR
  queue "Kafka:\nDLQ" as DLQ
  database "PostgreSQL\n(Campaign / ReachTask)" as DB
}

[Email Provider\n(SendGrid/SES)] as EP

' ===== 垂直分層：強制 上→下 排列 =====
EVAL -[hidden]down-> P_SHARED
P_SHARED -[hidden]down-> ORC
EA  -[hidden]down-> RR
DB  -[hidden]down-> EP
' 基礎設施鎖成同一橫排
DE -[hidden]right-> RR
RR -[hidden]right-> DB
DB -[hidden]right-> DLQ

' ===== 主幹互動（精簡，僅核心流）=====
MK --> API : 設定活動 (REST)
STORE --> DE : 發行為事件
DE --> CC : 消費
CC --> RR : ReachRequested
SCH --> RR : ReachRequested
RR --> ORC : 消費（唯一消費者）
ORC --> DB : 建立 ReachTask
DSP --> EA
EA --> EP
DSP --> DLQ : 重試耗盡

' ===== 區塊意圖 note（置於兩側）=====
note left of P_CAMPAIGN
  **campaign 區用意**
  只負責「定義活動 + 判定是否觸發」，
  不碰發送；透過 Kafka 事件交棒給 reach。
end note

note right of INFRA
  **為何單體內仍用 Kafka**
  觸達需非同步、可重試、可削峰、可重放。
  兩條觸發路徑收斂到同一 reach.requested topic，
  下游發送邏輯只寫一次；也保留日後拆服務的縫。
end note
@enduml
